OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPersistent
OL,6,Frain for the evening, turning heavier
OL,7,Fat times, before clearing overnight,
OL,8,Fto leave only a few scattered showers
OL,9,Fcome dawn, these mainly across Argyll.
OL,10,FBrisk southerly winds easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA day of showers mixed with
OL,13,Fbrighter spells, with outbreaks
OL,14,Ffrequent across Argyll, occasional
OL,15,Faround Glasgow and isolated to the
OL,16,Fsouth and east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
